  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1923.01 Junk or Dismantled Vehicles\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 261:22, each notification of a junk or dismantled vehicle shall be submitted by a dealer, repair person, junk dealer, or owner within 30 days to the National Motor Vehicle Title Information System (NMVTIS).\n\n(b) The previous title, if available, shall be furnished to the bureau.\n\nSource. #4823, eff 6-1-90; ss by #4981, eff 11-16-90; ss by #6293, eff 7-23-96; ss by #8123, INTERIM, eff 7-17-04, EXPIRED: 1-13-05\n\nNew. #8339, eff 4-26-05; ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1900.html"
